#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:9
msgid "声明式包与静态绑定合同"
msgstr "Declarative package and static binding contracts"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:11
msgid ""
"本页拥有包字段、快照、领域投影和静态连接的规则。逐步接入见[Provider指南](../../guides/provider-"
"porting.md)，硬件算法由C11维护，CMake拥有唯一源码图。"
msgstr ""
"This page owns package-field, snapshot, domain-projection, and static-"
"connection rules. See the [Provider guide](../../guides/provider-porting.md)"
" for integration steps. Hardware algorithms remain in C11, and CMake owns "
"the single source graph."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:13
msgid "包、事实与目录"
msgstr "Packages, facts and directories"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:29
msgid ""
"这是当前 F4 的维护布局。binding 与其私有 C 类型和实现相邻；只有真实共享的 "
"合同、片段与算法保留共享入口。跨家族提取需要相同编程模型的证据。运行调用保持 公共 face 到具体 provider 的直接分派，见 "
"[源码归属图](../../assets/diagrams/driver-source-ownership.svg)。"
msgstr ""
"This is the current F4 maintenance layout. Bindings stay beside their "
"private C types and implementations; shared entries retain only contracts, "
"fragments and algorithms that are actually shared. Cross-family extraction "
"requires evidence of the same programming model. Runtime calls retain direct"
" dispatch from public faces to concrete providers; see the [source ownership"
" diagram](../../assets/diagrams/driver-source-ownership.svg)."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "package 字段"
msgstr "Package field"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "合同"
msgstr "Contract"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "`schema_version`／`interface_version`"
msgstr "`schema_version` / `interface_version`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "独立格式与工具协议，未知版本拒绝"
msgstr "Separate format and tool protocol; unknown versions reject"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "`id`／`family`／`vendor`"
msgstr "`id` / `family` / `vendor`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "显式身份；重复不能靠搜索优先级覆盖"
msgstr ""
"Explicit identities; duplicate entries cannot override through search "
"precedence"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "`source_directory`"
msgstr "`source_directory`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "相对 `package.json` 所在目录解析的所属源码根"
msgstr ""
"The owning source root, resolved relative to the directory containing "
"`package.json`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "`facts`"
msgstr "`facts`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid ""
"`soc`／`routes`；按选定 provider 另给 "
"`controllers`／`clocks`／`device_catalog`／`references`／`review_profiles`／`bindings`"
msgstr ""
"`soc`/`routes`, plus "
"`controllers`/`clocks`/`device_catalog`/`references`/`review_profiles`/`bindings`"
" as required by the selected provider"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "`binding_files`"
msgstr "`binding_files`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "显式有序输入列表，不能重复、越界或冒充其他权威输入"
msgstr ""
"Explicit ordered inputs; no duplicates, escape or substitution for another "
"authoritative input"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "`dependencies`"
msgstr "`dependencies`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "引用既有依赖来源 ID，不另抄 URL、gitlink 或许可"
msgstr ""
"Reference existing dependency source IDs instead of copying URLs, gitlinks "
"or licenses"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "`cmake.entry`／`cmake.target`"
msgstr "`cmake.entry` / `cmake.target`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "选中包的构建入口与 target，不列第二份 `.c` 图"
msgstr "Selected package build entry and target, without a second `.c` graph"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "`exports.roots`／`exports.exclude`"
msgstr "`exports.roots` / `exports.exclude`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "包拥有的生产导出范围，不是当前 ELF 的编译闭包"
msgstr ""
"Package-owned production export scope, not the current ELF compilation "
"closure"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "`scope`"
msgstr "`scope`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "生产或 reference；reference 必须显式启用 test support"
msgstr "Production or reference; references explicitly require test support"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:46
msgid ""
"生产校验由 [packages.py](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/packages.py)拥有， [编辑器 "
"schema](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/configure/soc-package.schema.json)从同一字段合同派生。 在仓库根执行下列只读命令可打印当前 "
"JSON schema；输出不替代生产加载与资源校验。"
msgstr ""
"[packages.py](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/configure/packages.py) owns production validation. The [editor "
"schema](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/configure/soc-package.schema.json) derives from the same field "
"contract. From the repository root, this read-only command prints the "
"current JSON schema; its output does not replace production loading and "
"resource validation."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:54
msgid ""
"`facts`、`binding_files`、`cmake.entry` 和 `exports` 路径均相对已解析的 "
"`source_directory`；加载器检查所属边界、文件类型与 symlink。选择声明式包不执行家族 Python 模块；CMake 与 C "
"仍是受信构建代码，哈希只绑定身份，不构成执行沙箱。"
msgstr ""
"`facts`, `binding_files`, `cmake.entry` and `exports` paths are relative to "
"the resolved `source_directory`. The loader checks containment, file types "
"and symlinks. Selecting a declarative package does not execute family Python"
" modules. CMake and C remain trusted build code; hashes bind identity rather"
" than provide an execution sandbox."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:58
msgid "同一快照读取"
msgstr "Read one snapshot"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:60
msgid ""
"manifest、SoC、route、binding 主文件和每个 `binding_files` 都经同一受控 reader "
"读取并记录字节身份。重复读取不得换成另一代输入，生成结束前复核；资料、器件选择 和私有硬件投影不得绕过该快照重新打开文件并产生第二份决策。事实按 "
"manifest 的 逻辑键读取，不要求文件必须叫 `soc.json` 或 `routes.json`。"
msgstr ""
"The manifest, SoC, routes, main binding file and every `binding_files` "
"member pass through one controlled reader that records their byte "
"identities. Repeated reads cannot switch input generations; inputs are "
"checked again before generation completes. References, device selection and "
"private hardware projections cannot bypass that snapshot by reopening files "
"to make independent decisions. Facts are read by the manifest's logical "
"keys; filenames need not be `soc.json` or `routes.json`."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:65
msgid ""
"F4 的 `facts.soc` 保留身份、CPU、精确型号、device profile、封装／内存与供应依赖 身份；可选 "
"`facts.controllers` 独占 `controller_groups`／`can_domain`，可选 `facts.clocks` 独占"
" `clock_profiles`。通用 `read_soc` 通过同一 reader 组合这些输入；base 与片段 "
"重复声明同字段、片段未知字段或错误 schema 均拒绝。未声明片段的参考包仍可使用 内联事实。资料仅由 `facts.references` "
"选择；timebase 由 System binding 的角色 选择，Board 查询和生产解析使用同一资源预留结果，不再各自维护默认 timer。"
msgstr ""
"F4 `facts.soc` retains identity, CPU, exact parts, device profiles, "
"package/memory facts and supplier dependency identity. Optional "
"`facts.controllers` exclusively owns `controller_groups`/`can_domain`; "
"optional `facts.clocks` exclusively owns `clock_profiles`. Generic "
"`read_soc` composes these inputs through the same reader. Duplicate fields "
"between the base and fragments, unknown fragment fields and invalid schemas "
"are rejected. Reference packages without fragments may retain inline facts. "
"Only `facts.references` selects reference documents. The System binding role"
" selects the timebase; Board queries and production resolution use the same "
"resource reservations instead of maintaining separate default timers."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:73
msgid ""
"生产 DataProvider 包必须同时声明 `facts.references` 与 `facts.review_profiles`； "
"只读取包元数据的 `packages.load` 不受此约束。DataProvider 经同一 reader 读取后构造 不可变 "
"ProfileSet，显式持有手册、数据手册、勘误身份与适用范围。通用工具不内置 F4 的资料表，不默认选择某个勘误 profile。显式启用 test"
" support 的 reference 包 可使用仅记录来源的 schema 1 资料，不取得生产资料或执行资格；原始资料身份、软件 "
"模式与实际执行仍分别校验。"
msgstr ""
"Production DataProvider packages must declare both `facts.references` and "
"`facts.review_profiles`; metadata-only `packages.load` is outside this "
"requirement. DataProvider uses the same reader to construct an immutable "
"ProfileSet holding explicit manual, datasheet and errata identities and "
"applicability. Generic tools embed no F4 reference tables and select no "
"errata profile by default. A reference package with test support explicitly "
"enabled may use schema 1 documents that record provenance only, without "
"establishing reviewed production reference facts or execution qualification."
" Original reference identities, software modes and actual execution remain "
"separately validated."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:80
msgid ""
"binding 文件片段声明 `schema_version`、`bindings`，以及可选 `domains` 和 "
"`static_fragments`。控制器 binding 有序加入；重复 domain key 拒绝，不能用后读覆盖 先读。文件拆分与下文 "
"StaticFragments 的声明复用是两种机制，不能互相替代。"
msgstr ""
"Binding file fragments declare `schema_version`, `bindings` and optional "
"`domains` and `static_fragments`. Controller bindings append in order; "
"duplicate domain keys reject rather than allowing later reads to override "
"earlier ones. Splitting input files and the StaticFragments declaration "
"reuse below are different mechanisms, not substitutes."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:84
msgid ""
"所选 binding 文档的顶层 `pads` 是 pad 坐标的唯一作者来源，每个显式身份记录 `registers`、`port_index` 和 "
"`number`；不从 `PA0` 一类名字推导坐标。 `hardware.pads` 被拒绝。DataProvider 保存从同一文档构造的 "
"BindingPolicy，资源 校验与静态连接复用它的只读投影；不重新打开事实或维护第二张坐标表。具体 IP 的 "
"硬件模型按实际资源声明；软件参考不应伪造其他 IP 的 ADC／DMA 硬件协议。"
msgstr ""
"Top-level `pads` in the selected binding document is the sole authoring "
"source for pad coordinates. Each explicit identity records `registers`, "
"`port_index` and `number`; coordinates are not inferred from names such as "
"`PA0`. `hardware.pads` is rejected. DataProvider retains a BindingPolicy "
"constructed from the same document. Resource validation and static "
"connections reuse its read-only projection without reopening facts or "
"maintaining a second coordinate table. Each IP hardware model declares "
"actual resources; software references must not fabricate ADC/DMA hardware "
"protocols belonging to another IP."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:90
msgid "公共领域与私有绑定"
msgstr "Public domains and private bindings"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:92
msgid ""
"[DomainPolicies](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/domain_policies.py)读取包声明的格式、限额、 时钟、共享 "
"IRQ、数据流几何和具体领域／IP 政策。缺失领域不授予可选能力，不从厂家 名称、相似寄存器或目录推断支持。物理事实、可用模式、Board "
"路线与资源约束仍共同 决定某个完整装配是否合法。"
msgstr ""
"[DomainPolicies](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/domain_policies.py) reads package-"
"declared formats, limits, clocks, shared IRQs, stream geometry and concrete "
"domain/IP policies. Absent domains grant no optional capabilities. Vendor "
"names, similar registers and directory names do not imply support. Physical "
"facts, maintained modes, Board routes and resource constraints jointly "
"decide whether a complete assembly is valid."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:97
msgid ""
"公共语义在 UART／CAN／USB 等窄合同中维护；采集、SAI、波形、外部总线、存储与 图形政策在 "
"`tools/configure/policies/` 就近校验。新 IP 符合已有模型时增加数据与 C 绑定；模型不同则扩展经过审查的 policy "
"和测试，不给公共 resolver 增加型号条件。"
msgstr ""
"Narrow UART/CAN/USB contracts own public semantics. Capture, SAI, waveform, "
"external-bus, storage and graphics policies validate their domains under "
"`tools/configure/policies/`. New IP fitting an existing model adds data and "
"C bindings; a different model extends reviewed policy and tests rather than "
"adding model conditions to the public resolver."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:101
msgid ""
"`DomainPolicies.binding_values()` 的实际投影入口是 "
"`ControllerIntegrationIR.constants`。它是显式私有命名值索引：叶值由具体政策的 schema 校验，包含标量、冻结 "
"dataclass、tuple 与已解析引用。Packet、Graphics 等 记录只服务于所选绑定；外围装配仍使用具名不可变 IR。它不是任意 "
"resolved 字典， 也不新增可随意访问属性的 namespace facade。公共 IR 不为每个 IP 私有字段加成员。"
msgstr ""
"`ControllerIntegrationIR.constants` is the actual projection entry of "
"`DomainPolicies.binding_values()`. It is an explicit private named-value "
"index. Concrete policy schemas validate its leaves: scalars, frozen "
"dataclasses, tuples and resolved references. Packet, Graphics and similar "
"records serve only selected bindings; the surrounding assembly retains named"
" immutable IR. This is not an arbitrary resolved dictionary or a new "
"namespace facade allowing arbitrary attribute access. Public IR does not "
"gain a member for every private IP field."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:107
msgid "静态布局与模式选择"
msgstr "Static layouts and mode selection"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:109
msgid ""
"[DataProvider](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/configure/data_provider.py)连接已校验事实和 C 实现。 每条 binding 声明 "
"`kind`、`implementation`，并在 `mode` 与 `modes` 中二选一； `modes` 表示同一绑定允许的模式别名。可选 "
"`controllers` 限定实际控制器，候选 重叠或不唯一时拒绝，不按声明先后选一个实现。"
msgstr ""
"[DataProvider](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/configure/data_provider.py) connects validated facts and C "
"implementation. Each binding declares `kind`, `implementation` and exactly "
"one of `mode` or `modes`; `modes` lists aliases allowed by that binding. "
"Optional `controllers` narrows actual controllers. Overlapping or ambiguous "
"candidates reject rather than selecting the first declaration."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:114
msgid ""
"binding 可以选择一个 `static_recipe`，或用 `profiles` 映射已解析的 "
"`execution_profile`。profile 是公共语义与端点关系产生的有限键；未维护键拒绝， "
"不在固件中创建模式查找器。不同模式只承担自己选择的存储。"
msgstr ""
"A binding selects one `static_recipe` or uses `profiles` to map the resolved"
" `execution_profile`. A profile is a finite key derived from public "
"semantics and endpoint relationships. Unmaintained keys reject; firmware "
"gains no runtime mode registry. Each mode carries only its selected storage."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "机制"
msgstr "Mechanism"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "输入、产物和边界"
msgstr "Inputs, artifacts and boundaries"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "`StaticRecipe`"
msgstr "`StaticRecipe`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "为一个 owner 声明真实 C 类型、对象角色、常量、数组、引用及固定 admit／prepare／close／IRQ 连接"
msgstr ""
"Declares real C types, object roles, constants, arrays, references and fixed"
" admit/prepare/close/IRQ connections for one owner"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "`StaticObjects`"
msgstr "`StaticObjects`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "为已选择的共享或平台记录声明固定命名对象和连接，不生成硬件状态机"
msgstr ""
"Declares fixed named objects and connections for selected shared/platform "
"records, without generating hardware state machines"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "`SharedIrqGroup`"
msgstr "`SharedIrqGroup`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "核对实际 handler、相同优先级、互斥 source mask 与不同 state，生成一个有界分发表和薄入口"
msgstr ""
"Checks the actual handler, matching priority, disjoint source masks and "
"distinct states; emits one bounded dispatch table and thin entry"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "`ChildGroups`"
msgstr "`ChildGroups`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "为已有 controller 的有界 endpoint 元组生成私有存储、face 与固定调用，不再取得第二个 controller"
msgstr ""
"Generates private storage, faces and fixed calls for a bounded endpoint "
"tuple of an existing controller, without acquiring a second controller"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "`IrqConnection`"
msgstr "`IrqConnection`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:0
msgid "显式固定 handler、调用与退出屏障，不用正则重写生成 C"
msgstr ""
"Explicit fixed handler, calls and exit barrier; no regex rewriting of "
"generated C"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:126
msgid ""
"静态 recipe 的 `source` 只遍历命名不可变 IR；`ref` 只能引用当前布局的已声明角色。 有界 map 只展开已解析 "
"tuple，不能嵌套任意循环。明确的可选值和枚举映射用于静态 布局，不会将未支持模式换成别的模式。C 编译器检查私有结构、函数签名、对齐和 "
"初始化；主机工具不猜测 ABI 或 `sizeof`，也不执行任意 C 字符串。"
msgstr ""
"A static recipe `source` traverses only named immutable IR, and `ref` can "
"address only declared roles in the current layout. Bounded maps expand "
"resolved tuples without arbitrary nested loops. Explicit optional values and"
" enum maps determine static layout; they never replace an unsupported mode "
"with another one. The C compiler checks private structures, function "
"signatures, alignment and initialization. Host tools do not infer ABI or "
"`sizeof`, or execute arbitrary C strings."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:131
msgid "单层 StaticFragments"
msgstr "Single-level StaticFragments"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:133
msgid ""
"[StaticFragments](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/static_fragments.py)已接入生产 DataProvider。"
" 文件片段顶层 `static_fragments` 合入选中软件的 `software.static_fragments`，分为 "
"`declarations` 与 `values` 两库。每库在整个选中包内使用统一名字，重名拒绝，不允许 "
"后读覆盖。尚未使用的片段也检查有限语法；不据机制接入声称所有 F4 模式已采用。"
msgstr ""
"[StaticFragments](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/static_fragments.py) is connected to "
"production DataProvider. A file fragment's top-level `static_fragments` "
"joins the selected software's `software.static_fragments`, separating "
"`declarations` and `values` libraries. Each library shares one namespace "
"across the selected package. Duplicate names reject; later reads cannot "
"override earlier ones. Unused fragments also undergo bounded syntax "
"validation. Connecting the mechanism does not establish adoption by every F4"
" mode."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:138
msgid ""
"使用点只允许完整 `use` 引用：声明列表中的引用平铺声明列表，其他引用只替换一个值。 "
"不能带参数、覆盖字段、merge、引用另一个片段或执行表达式；引用层数为一，有界 record／array 本身仍可嵌套。"
msgstr ""
"Use sites accept only an exact `use` reference: a reference in a declaration"
" list expands that list; other references substitute one value. Parameters, "
"field overrides, merges, references to another fragment and expressions are "
"forbidden. References have one level; bounded records/arrays themselves may "
"still nest."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:142
msgid ""
"展开只复用作者数据，不创建新模式或硬件行为。在 Binding／Profile 创建前展开，之后仍由 StaticRecipe 校验实际 "
"角色、类型、引用和长度；不能因为片段在另一处合法就跳过本处作用域检查。"
msgstr ""
"Expansion reuses authored data without creating modes or hardware behavior. "
"Expansion precedes Binding/Profile creation; StaticRecipe then checks actual"
" roles, types, references and lengths. Validity elsewhere does not waive "
"this use site's scope checks."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:145
msgid "固件行为与 C 常量"
msgstr "Firmware behavior and C constants"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:147
msgid ""
"硬件 admission、MMIO、readback、等待、IRQ 处理、停止、部分清理与恢复全部由 手写 C 执行。优先复用满足完整模式合同的官方 "
"HAL／LL；SDK Handle 保持私有，同一 live 行为域只有一个 owner。factory 只返回已有 face，不取得硬件或创建任务。"
msgstr ""
"Handwritten C executes hardware admission, MMIO, readback, waiting, IRQ "
"handling, stop, partial cleanup and recovery. Prefer official HAL/LL "
"satisfying the complete mode contract. SDK Handles remain private, with one "
"owner per live behavior domain. Factory returns existing faces without "
"acquiring hardware or creating tasks."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/package-bindings.md:151
msgid ""
"RCC PLL／分频编码、ADC 分辨率、SAI 帧长度和 LTDC 累加时序在私有 C 常量入口计算。 例如 ClockPlan "
"保存物理分频与频率，`stm32f4_clock_encoding.h` 使用锁定 CMSIS 位定义形成初始化常量。配置政策先验证合法范围，C "
"编译器再处理编码；这些常量表达式 不访问寄存器，不增加运行时解释器。实际寄存器顺序、等待与失败仍由 C owner 负责。"
msgstr ""
"Private C constant entries encode RCC PLL/dividers, ADC resolution, SAI "
"frame length and LTDC accumulated timing. For example, ClockPlan retains "
"physical dividers and frequencies while `stm32f4_clock_encoding.h` forms "
"initialization constants using locked CMSIS bit definitions. Configuration "
"policies first validate legal ranges, then the C compiler handles encoding. "
"These constant expressions access no registers and add no runtime "
"interpreter. C owners still implement real register ordering, waits and "
"failure handling."
